<title>UK: BS Group finance director resigns.</title>
<headline>BS Group finance director resigns.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bristol-based property and leisure company BS Group Plc said on Tuesday that finance director Geoffrey Bland had resigned to pursue other business opportunities.</p>
<p>Bland had been a director for 10 years and finance director for four.</p>
<p>The company is looking for a replacement but in the meantime the duties of finance director will be taken over by the financial controller, Hamish Salmond.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
